  "body": "Filters are confusing. Look at /messages. The request has a `limit` field, but it also has a `filter`, which also has a `limit` field. Also, why doesn't /messages use the create filter, use filter id logic? The spec says you have to give it a roomeventfilter directly. Shouldn't it be possible to both use a saved filter and give it a new filter?",
